OL,3,GNEWSACourt of Appeal overturns decision
OL,4,Ato block work on NI's largest road
OL,5,Aproject
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Court of Appeal in Belfast
OL,8,Foverturns a decision to block work on
OL,9,Fone of Northern Ireland's largest ever
OL,10,Froad projects, the A5
OL,12,FLady Chief Justice Siobhan Keegan has
OL,13,Fbeen delivering the verdict, working
OL,14,Fthrough the four main grounds of the
OL,15,Flegal challenge, and described the
OL,16,Flegal history of the project as "long
OL,17,Fand torturous"
OL,19,FShe has said the original judge's
OL,20,Ffindings that the plans breached human
OL,21,Frights should be reversed
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,412,410,260,120,0,100
