OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSACourt of Appeal overturns decision
OL,4,Ato block work on NI's largest road
OL,5,Aproject
OL,6,
OL,7,FLady Justice Keegan also said that
OL,8,Fwhile it "will increase emissions", the
OL,9,Fplans should proceed despite how it
OL,10,Fintersects with the Climate Change Act
OL,12,FLast year a judge ruled against the
OL,13,Fproject going ahead in its current
OL,14,Fform, upholding a legal challenge taken
OL,15,Fby a group of landowners - he said the
OL,16,Fplans breached climate change targets
OL,17,Fand criticised "an inadequacy of
OL,18,Finformation"
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
