OL,3,GNEWSACourt of Appeal overturns decision
OL,4,Ato block work on NI's largest road
OL,5,Aproject
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe 58-mile (94km) #1.7bn project had
OL,8,Fbeen given a fresh green light by
OL,9,FStormont ministers in October 2024 but
OL,10,Fa group of landowners brought a legal
OL,11,Fchallenge in 2025
OL,13,FMore than 50 people have died on the A5
OL,14,Fsince 2006 and campaigners have long
OL,15,Fcalled for the road to be upgraded
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/3
